# Implementation Plan: LastHope Barista Coffee Game Landing Page & Game Gateway

Build a visually stunning, coffee-themed landing page for the LastHope Barista Game at `/`, integrate it with the existing LastHope authentication system, create the protected `/game` route, and ensure a seamless player journey from landing to café shift.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - Existing authentication infrastructure (JWT, cookies, MongoDB, Firebase Google OAuth, `/login`, `/signup`, `/dashboard`) will be 100% preserved.
> - The root route `/` will now serve the new `LandingPage` (accessible to both visitors and logged-in players).
> - The primary post-authentication destination will be `/game` (with `/dashboard` preserved for player account & session details).
> - On the Landing Page, authenticated players will see dynamic personalized greetings ("Welcome back, {user.name}") and "CONTINUE SHIFT" buttons directly linking to `/game`.

